#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Networking Engine
#  File: networking_engine.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS networking engine responsible for:
#      • routing table management
#      • TCP/UDP service hosting
#      • async socket handling
#      • protocol dispatch
#      • network event orchestration
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Routing Table](ca://s?q=Explain_Routing_Table)
#    - [TCP Services](ca://s?q=Explain_TCP_Services)
#    - [UDP Services](ca://s?q=Explain_UDP_Services)
#    - [Protocol Dispatch](ca://s?q=Explain_Protocol_Dispatch)
#    - [Network Snapshot](ca://s?q=Explain_Network_Snapshot)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - add_route(destination, gateway)
#         Adds routing entry.
#
#    - resolve(destination)
#         Resolves gateway for destination.
#
#    - register_service(name, port, protocol, handler)
#         Registers a network service.
#
#    - start_service(name)
#         Starts TCP/UDP service.
#
#    - stop_service(name)
#         Stops running service.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns full networking engine state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  SERVICE STRUCTURE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "name": "net.echo",
#      "port": 9000,
#      "protocol": "tcp",
#      "handler": <async callable>,
#      "active": true/false
#    }
#
